    <h2>Image credits</h2>
    <p>
      Medal images are files marked on Wikimedia Commons as U.S. government works and traced
      to the Army Institute of Heraldry, Arlington National Cemetery, the Air Force, or the
      Department of Defense. Three medals have a text plate because a public-domain
      government photograph could not be confirmed: the Distinguished Service Cross, the
      Navy and Marine Corps Medal, and the Coast Guard Medal. The Navy Cross image is the
      reverse. The Coast Guard Cross image is an Institute of Heraldry illustration.
    </p>
